# Ravine Raider double blocked (menace is satisfied by two creatures): Bot2's Llanowar Elves and Birds of Paradise block it. A 1/1 would die
# to the 1 damage the Elves deals, but Bot1 pays {1}{B} after blockers are declared: 2/2, it survives (damage 1 of toughness 2), and
# its 2 damage, assigned 1 to each, kills both blockers. The pump is until end of turn; nothing is left of it afterwards.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Ravine Raider
Plains x4
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Birds of Paradise
Forest x13

